Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=24}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.60,0:01:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An undersea volcano...\N Straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:01:58.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's about to blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pull back, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.51,0:02:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll live to plunder another day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah, Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:08.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't gotta ask me twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ankoro! Wadatsumi! Draw the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:13.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, Captain, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vander Decken is my name,\Nand these long-lost riches I'll get later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:18.02,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:21.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I don't know \Nhow the Kraken works,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:26.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but order him to turn\N around and haul ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:29.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:34.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's hauling ass just fine all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:37.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For such a {\i1}giant monster{\i0},\Nit's kind of shameful, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares? I would be doing the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He runs terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.21,0:02:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give him a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.82,0:02:48.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be clumsy and\Nalive than graceful and dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:50.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like... me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is mouth brow doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.89,0:02:56.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoo! Yeah! Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's rehab!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on! I wanna see lava!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evacuate to the front of the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna help!\NIt's just a couple of feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you got your lava, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.43,0:03:31.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's getting hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:34.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me we could\Nbe boiled alive down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ocean sure hates us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:35.47,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:48.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their ship's flying. Is that good or bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:54.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Faster, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:58.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't hurry it up,\Nsomebody is gonna be eating
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.27,0:04:01.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,your delicious cooked carcass\Nfrom off the ocean floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Riding him is pretty fun,\Nbut eating him might be even better!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.17,0:04:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The temperature change–\Nit's causing a vortex in the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:18.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,which direction is Fishman Island?\NWe can't lose our wa–
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.21,0:04:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not ready for real girls yet, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:23.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go back to your pictures and relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1019)}Straight ahead. I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, jump into the trench!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:44.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:48.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,922)}That's not a place you jump! It's an abyss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's nothing but\Nblackness down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fish people live there?\N They've gotta be insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lava! There's lava behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the void in front of us! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't we go up?\NUp, where it's not burning and dark
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:12.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and everything wants to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! You're not really Luffy, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:17.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're some evil demon who looks\N like him that wants to drag us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.03,0:05:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to the depths of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare! Why\Ncan't I wake up? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:23.47,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Surume! Jump in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's erupting again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:36.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something's coming down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boulders?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A mudslide?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an avalanche! Brace yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The eruption knocked the rocks loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dodge the boulders, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit here; I'm gonna go cut 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, hold onto my leg, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.87,0:05:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure! Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:05:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:01.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ship is over 8,000 meters deep right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:06.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never mind the boulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:07.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go outside and the water\N pressure will crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:09.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine, but we gotta do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:14.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack, Green Star...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sargasso!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp made seaweed appear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:25.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:28.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It won't hold for very long, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:30.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta get moving, Surume! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Monster plants? Aw man! That's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:52.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder what else you\Nhave in that bag of tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:52.16,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes, I know I'm awesome.\NPraise me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're in the clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.03,0:06:59.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were pretty great, too, Surume!\NThanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:00.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You saved us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:04.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume! Yay!\N– Surume! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume! Yay!\N– Surume! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume! Yay!\N– Surume! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume! Yay!\N– Surume! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:10.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Suru–\N– Suru–
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we alive? Or dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:40.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's light,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.51,0:07:42.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we're so deep in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:45.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So bright! I've got stars in my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.45,0:07:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rather, just stars. There aren't any eyes.\NNya, ho, ho, ho...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over there! I think we made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.59,0:07:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything. It's too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:07:59.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Nami. Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep! There's no doubt about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.07,0:08:04.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The needle is pointing straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:09.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:11.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's in a giant bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.21,0:08:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like they have clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There must be air inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:24.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:29.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The New World is next! Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.29,0:08:33.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, what do ya know.\NThe morons survived after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:38.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is where the mermaids live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Real-life, beautiful mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:42.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My dream can finally come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How I've longed to see\Ntheir faces. To touch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:46.48,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:46.48,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Whoa! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ♪ A mermaid for me! ♪\N– ♪ A mermaid for me! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ♪ A mermaid for you! ♪\N– ♪ A mermaid for you! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ♪ A mermaid for– ♪\N– ♪ A mermaid for– ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:58.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold up! You're not ready for this!\NYou shouldn't even think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:08:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.57,0:09:10.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought my treatment would do the trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know it's your dream,\Nbut you're not healthy enough for mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:22.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For him, this is a fate worse than death.\NThere's gotta be something you can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:24.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he sees mermaids, it will be death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.51,0:09:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:29.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:34.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I don't wanna live in\N a world without dreams...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.33,0:09:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die leering at some hot mermaid tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:44.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who needs blood?\N I have lust to sustain me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His lechery burns bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet they fry up all kinds of yummy\Ndeep-sea monsters down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wipe up that drool
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:57.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and tell Surume to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.85,0:10:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's an entrance around here\Nsomewhere, and we've gotta find it.
Comment: 0,0:09:59.85,0:10:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we've gotta find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.65,0:10:02.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys! We got company!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would you allow these foolish humans\Nto tell you what to do, Kraken?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, crap. That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.60,0:10:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sea monsters! Giant ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:21.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So close! And now we're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:26.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, they look tough! I want one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, is somebody riding 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1442,27)}What the heck, Surume?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1442,27)}Seriously, we were almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's like a whole circus of sea monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are the Straw\NHat Pirates, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:06.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have quite the reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:11.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For starters, you were the ones\Nwho ruined the Arlong Pirates' plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:16.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That part makes sense at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:19.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But for some reason,\N two years back,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when Hachi was in trouble,\Nyou stood up for your old enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then, you clocked one of the\NCelestial Dragons right in his ugly face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.11,0:11:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fisher Tiger happened to do the exact same\Nthing, and he's the hero of this entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fisher... Tiger...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:42.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm not sure what to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.79,0:11:44.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tell it to me straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:47.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Are you supposed to be our enemies or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How about I give you an option?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.66,0:11:55.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Enlist under our banner as members\Nof the New Fishman Pirates, or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:57.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}“Or else”{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:12:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,meaning we sink you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.37,0:12:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fuel up, Franky! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.71,0:12:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? You got a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You and I both know that Luffy\Nisn't gonna cooperate with these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we're 10,000 meters underwater\Nright now, and if we try to fight them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we don't stand a chance of winning,\Nespecially not with those sea monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, we have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.52,0:12:22.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need you to use all of the oxygen we have
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to make a giant Coup de Burst\Nso we can charge straight into Fishman Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, are you kiddin' me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've come way too far to die {\i1}here{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:37.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I agree. It's risky, but it's likely\N our only chance at surviving this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, I'm\Ngonna fill it up right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, steer the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be just super!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, have you decided if you want\Nto be part of our crew, Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. You wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did hear me say what will\Nhappen if you refuse, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:08.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess you {\i1}are{\i0} the enemy of the Fishmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing but filthy human scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would I wanna work\Nfor a big dumb fish face like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.45,0:13:20.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, Luffy. You'll make him mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:22.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a real shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.25,0:13:25.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't be seeing Fishman Island after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:28.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get ready to sink, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:30.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sea Lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, filled up and ready to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:38.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky! You're up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:42.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't forget, we got {\i1}our own lion{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.61,0:13:53.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can fight some other time, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.09,0:13:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at 'em go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't breathe. There's no more air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're getting squished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.70,0:14:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hard to breathe,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.65,0:14:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and that's not just because I don't have lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:29.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hang on! We'll make it, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:36.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?!\NWhat's up with that crazy ship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.03,0:14:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're on our way in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:40.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be with you soon, beautiful mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:50.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We lost the coating!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It got stuck when we crossed the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:14:59.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,514)}This bubble. It's a double structure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A normal ship would crash\Nbecause there's nothing but air!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're about to run into another bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:36.05,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(1081,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}This current is really strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help... me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(1216,0,1,\c&H000000&}Can't breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:48.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(1481,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Crap. Four of us can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:15:59.64,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(685,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:02.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Reach!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:06.68,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:08.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:11.79,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:14.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2016,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}I can't resist the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's one way to get in.\NPretty reckless, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we can still go in after\Nthem if you want to, Hammond.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way to know if they're\Nalive or dead though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:41.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's track them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.99,0:16:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let Neptune's Army get their\Nhands on them first, now can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:50.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But before we do anything, we should go\Nback to Noah and tell the boss what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think he'd want to know that the man\Nwho ruined Arlong's plan is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:07.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:11.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:14.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares if I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now he's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:22.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, he didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.73,0:17:24.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He might've moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:25.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares if he moved?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:33.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:38.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:42.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:44.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, how are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:50.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Camie!\N It's nice to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Camie, you've gotten so lovely! Marry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we made it to Fishman Island after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:17:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From what I understand,\Nwe were about to drown,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but then we were rescued\N by a bunch of mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:04.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.97,0:18:07.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji, Chopper, and I just\N woke up a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess we're pretty lucky, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:11.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucky enough to wake up in Camie's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:14.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh. So, this is your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:19.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know I was supposed to\N pick you guys up on Sabaody,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:21.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, but I was thinking that was another month from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.95,0:18:23.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:26.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like we got separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.86,0:18:32.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goodness. I hope they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, they're lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Before I blacked out,\N I was trying to follow them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that current must've pulled\N them off in a different direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, gotcha!\NWell, I'm sure it'll turn out okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:44.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.57,0:18:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bonehead can't do much underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:50.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the robot and Moss Head\Nare probably with him. So, I wouldn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope I get to see them again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're all freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, I made some soup\Nthat'll warm you right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:01.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:03.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cold seaweed soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.73,0:19:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.63,0:19:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's... {\i1}cold{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:17.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not right! How are you supposed\Nto get warm if the soup is cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:23.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm such a failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:28.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But your soup is great, Camie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:31.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm warmer already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:35.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, let me try some, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are dry, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:40.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, they're not dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.37,0:19:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your clothes might be dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:45.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares if they're dry?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.97,0:19:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You took care of our clothes, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:53.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.14,0:19:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are those little guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.41,0:19:59.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're some friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.35,0:20:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Medaka Mermaid Quintuplets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Ichika!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Nika!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.32,0:20:04.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Sanka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:05.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Yonka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.22,0:20:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm Yonka Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, why are there {\i1}two{\i0} Yonkas?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're really fast swimmers,\Nand pretty clever as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.73,0:20:13.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Nice to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.93,0:20:16.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got a lot of neat friends here, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}This is the sea floor of the Mermaid Cove,\Nhome to the girls' dorm of the famous Mermaid Café!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NThe Girls' dorm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:25.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me everything about\Nthis Mermaid Café place!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:32.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just this cute little café\Nwhere I work as a waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:34.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have a lot of pretty\Nmermaids there on staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Sounds like heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I get you anything extra?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.06,0:20:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sanji!\N– Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:49.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– False alarm!\N– False alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swore...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.30,0:20:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I made a promise to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.27,0:20:57.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that for the entire time I was on Fishman Island
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.87,0:21:00.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't get a nosebleed and pass out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I've held out for this long,\Nso I deserve a reward, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(880.44,906.06,1326.21,1080)}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.05,0:21:10.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(944.20,887.39,1297.7,1080)}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(1006.96,915.89,1338,1080)}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:10.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(1070.72,937.5,1290.81,1080)}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:11.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:13.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't we go up there now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll introduce you to all of my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.23,0:21:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! A turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:23.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Sea Turtle Elevator," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.13,0:21:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could you give us a lift, Mr. Turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:35.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a coral apartment complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The dorms are at the very\Nbottom, so rent's cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The top floor's the most expensive\Nbecause it gets natural light.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:44.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you're poor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what about Hachi and Pappagu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:49.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hatchin got beat up real bad about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I heard about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was protecting the Sunny for us\Nback on Sabaody, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.13,0:21:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hatchin came from the Fishman District, so\Nthat's where he's been resting and recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.77,0:22:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I haven't had the chance to see him lately,\Nbut from what I hear, he's getting better all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? He's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:06.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. But it's kind of a rough part of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.81,0:22:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you guys go along with me, I wouldn't mind\Nheading over there to visit him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:11.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.61,0:22:13.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to thank him face-to-face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.78,0:22:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.59,0:22:18.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And, well, as for Pappagu...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:21.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a super-famous fashion designer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:27.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, he lives in a big fancy mansion\Nin the high-class district of Fishverly Hills!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to deliver some clams over\Nthere today. You wanna come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.37,0:22:33.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's your pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.30,0:22:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you two don't live in the same place?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.44,0:22:39.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, 'cause that area's\Na little out of my price range.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.01,0:22:42.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have better clams here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're almost to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:48.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, what's that\Ndrinking-straw-looking tube dealie?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:49.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh. That thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.79,0:22:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the Water Road.\NThe bubble craftsmen built it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.59,0:22:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And when mermaids or \Nfish get inside it... Well, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.59,0:22:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, let me show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.33,0:23:08.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the surface! We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.27,0:23:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm swimming in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.88,0:23:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Oh, wow!\N– I wanna do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we're underwater,\Nwhy do I see a sky full of clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.29,0:23:26.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.09,0:23:27.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:30.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.56,0:23:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are these your pirate friends?\NI guess that means they didn't drown after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:42.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You didn't come in through the entrance like\Nyou're supposed to, so we were concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.21,0:23:46.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not as scary as I thought you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:49.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you broke in?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.95,0:23:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's pretty hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I kinda have a thing for pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.83,0:24:05.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like a real-life fairy tale!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.29,0:24:09.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A coral paradise!\NA whole cove full of mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.38,0:24:26.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with Sanji now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.42,0:24:29.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He didn't even cry this hard\Nwhen he left the Baratie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.39,0:24:34.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.26,0:24:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found my All Blue after all these years!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.86,0:24:43.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1320,1053)}Are you sure about that? {\i1}Really{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.70,0:24:46.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, let me introduce everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.04,0:24:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Luffy-chin. He's the captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.54,0:24:50.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.37,0:24:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-chin's the crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.61,0:24:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The nose guy is Usopp-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.71,0:24:56.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.95,0:24:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the raccoon is Chopper-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.12,0:25:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.42,0:25:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.32,0:25:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.69,0:25:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's dance in the water together!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.76,0:25:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.40,0:25:19.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is obviously too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.00,0:25:21.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe... I'm destined to die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:23.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.27,0:25:26.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What the heck happened to you in the\N last two years to make you this gloomy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.78,0:25:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't this supposed to be\Nthe land of your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.61,0:25:34.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You crack me up, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.02,0:25:35.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,819)}– I don't think he's joking!\N– I don't think he's joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.83,0:25:46.10,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,{\an8}Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.10,0:25:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,{\an8}So, Straw Hat {\i1}finally{\i0} made it to our turf,\Ndid he? Good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.60,0:25:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:56.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are we gonna do about it, Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.77,0:26:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to bring him here...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.78,0:26:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and quickly.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=25}===============================DIALOGUE============================
